    <tr><td>Pre-build for 3 delayed windows</td><td>213&nbsp;s</td><td>29&nbsp;s (database level, 2 built + 1 spare)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Wait on a borrowed pool (case A)</td><td>63–99&nbsp;s</td><td>median 34&nbsp;s (WordPress level), 9&nbsp;s (database level)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Edge stack <code>down</code></td><td>24&nbsp;s (five containers killed after the 10&nbsp;s grace period)</td><td>8&nbsp;s, nothing killed</td></tr>
